L0@P0: 412.581 OFFICERS.
L1@P0: In any city operating under Optional Plan A except a city having a larger council under Minnesota
L2@P0: Statutes 1994, section 412.023, subdivision 4, the council shall be composed of five or seven members
L3@P0: consisting, except during the initial period of its operation as provided in section 412.571, of the mayor and
L4@P0: four or six council members and, except as provided in that section, the clerk and treasurer or clerk-treasurer
L5@P0: shall be appointed by the council for indefinite terms.
L6@P0: History: 1949 c 119 s 74; 1965 c 417 s 11; 1967 c 289 s 13; 1974 c 337 s 11; 1986 c 444; 1989 c 30 s
L7@P0: 9; 1997 c 7 art 1 s 136; 2016 c 158 art 1 s 183
